{"schemaVersion":1,"id":18,"sections":[{"id":"110001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[570],"start":0,"count":13},{"id":"110001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10560],"start":13,"count":9},{"id":"110002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[580],"start":22,"count":13},{"id":"110002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10570],"start":35,"count":8},{"id":"110003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[590],"start":43,"count":5},{"id":"110003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10580],"start":48,"count":8}],"frames":[{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:2","scriptId":570,"text":"“该往哪走呢？看上去丛林那条路应该是捷径，那就走丛林---”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":null,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:3","scriptId":570,"text":"“恩，从地图上看现在的应该走左边的丛林地带，这样应该能加快不少速度。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":223,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":108,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:4","scriptId":570,"text":"“哼，丛林虽然可以让我们快速抵达目的地，但是中间潜伏着多少敌人还未可知。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":223,"right":108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:5","scriptId":570,"text":"“我决定从旁边的高地走。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":223,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":231,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:6","scriptId":570,"text":"“所以说小奈乐没有作战经验啊～越是危险的地形越是有进军的价值。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:7","scriptId":570,"text":"“这次任务的总指挥是我，往哪走我说了算！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":231,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:8","scriptId":570,"text":"“那么副指挥的意见呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:9","scriptId":570,"text":" 盯----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":231,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:10","scriptId":570,"text":" 笑容满面----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:11","scriptId":570,"text":"（诶！？怎么把矛头指向我了？）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:12","scriptId":570,"text":"“那个，考虑到佐伊她们的情况，我觉得走高地应该会更加稳妥，毕竟我们这次的任务是侦察，并不是很急。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":109,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:13","scriptId":570,"text":"“好，就这样办！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":3,"right":109,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":231,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-PROLOGUE:570:14","scriptId":570,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":109,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110001-EPILOGUE:10560:0","scriptId":10560,"text":"虽然高地上也遭遇了不少战车兽，但是因为都是可预见的情况，所以并没有造成任何负担。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":109,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110001-EPILOGUE:10560:2","scriptId":10560,"text":"蕾贝卡凑到我边上小声说道。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":109,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":231,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-EPILOGUE:10560:3","scriptId":10560,"text":"“没想到长官还是个会照顾队员的温柔之人啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":109,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-EPILOGUE:10560:4","scriptId":10560,"text":"“佐伊她们经验尚浅，比起赶路还是不要弄出什么突发情况比较好。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":231,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-EPILOGUE:10560:5","scriptId":10560,"text":"“战场上的温柔确实是很深入人心啊，没把钢舞姬们当兵器看待，你以后肯定是个好司令～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-EPILOGUE:10560:6","scriptId":10560,"text":"“过奖了。你还不是看透了奈乐对你的逆反心理，故意引导她选高地路线？真是个好姐姐。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":227,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-EPILOGUE:10560:7","scriptId":10560,"text":"“那个……我只是做了我该做的～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":227,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":231,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110001-EPILOGUE:10560:8","scriptId":10560,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110001-EPILOGUE:10560:9","scriptId":10560,"text":"在那之后蕾贝卡一言不发盯着我看了半天……难道我说错什么话了？","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:2","scriptId":580,"text":"“报告前面发现小群战车兽，是否要发动攻击？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":237,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:3","scriptId":580,"text":"“恩，由于高地地形视野非常良好，所以我们可以从远处先发制人。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":81,"right":237,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":237,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:4","scriptId":580,"text":"“而从这个位置能攻击对面的只有普莉玛了，那么接下来----”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":81,"right":237,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:5","scriptId":580,"text":"“我知道我知道！应该把敌人的正确位置传给普莉玛，进行第一波火炮射击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":31,"right":237,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":237,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:6","scriptId":580,"text":"“恩～满分，差不多就是这个感觉。在战场上的判断不要一味的交由长官来下，有些时候该如何行动还是要自己判断。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":31,"right":237,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":98,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:7","scriptId":580,"text":"“火炮就位，随时可以攻击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":98,"right":237,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:8","scriptId":580,"text":"“那就开炮！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":98,"right":32,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":97,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:9","scriptId":580,"text":"“那个还没告诉我坐标位置……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":97,"right":32,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":35,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:10","scriptId":580,"text":"“啊！不好意思……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":97,"right":35,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:11","scriptId":580,"text":"“嘻嘻，笨蛋佐伊，真是一点长进都没啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":81,"right":35,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:12","scriptId":580,"text":"“要你管……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":81,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":257,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:13","scriptId":580,"text":"“还差得远呢，菜鸟们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":257,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":237,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-PROLOGUE:580:14","scriptId":580,"text":"“慢慢来，战场上切忌急躁。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":257,"right":237,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":256,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-EPILOGUE:10570:1","scriptId":10570,"text":"“刚才的作战，佐伊的隐蔽行动做得太差，基本不懂得找掩体攻击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":256,"right":237,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":34,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-EPILOGUE:10570:2","scriptId":10570,"text":"“是，我知道了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":256,"right":34,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":83,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-EPILOGUE:10570:3","scriptId":10570,"text":"“佐伊就是容易头脑过热～～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":83,"right":34,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":254,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-EPILOGUE:10570:4","scriptId":10570,"text":"“莉娜你也好不到哪去，突击太过靠前，容易脱离火力支援范围。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":254,"right":34,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":86,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-EPILOGUE:10570:5","scriptId":10570,"text":"“呃……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":254,"right":86,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":235,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-EPILOGUE:10570:6","scriptId":10570,"text":"“至于普莉玛就不用多说了吧，犹豫不决的毛病还是那么严重……火炮就是要果断。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":235,"right":86,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":92,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-EPILOGUE:10570:7","scriptId":10570,"text":"“恩……我会注意的……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":235,"right":92,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110002-EPILOGUE:10570:8","scriptId":10570,"text":"（有这两位战斗精英指导以后，佐伊她们想必也会有长足的进步吧。）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":235,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-PROLOGUE:590:2","scriptId":590,"text":"“看起来路程还是挺顺利的嘛，基本我们都不需要出手。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":223,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-PROLOGUE:590:3","scriptId":590,"text":"“隆美尔司令这是出了钱给我们队员补课，真是太感谢了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":223,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-PROLOGUE:590:4","scriptId":590,"text":"“太正经的任务接多了，这种程度的护卫任务和放松差不多啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":223,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":108,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-PROLOGUE:590:5","scriptId":590,"text":"“所以说老爸真是喜欢瞎操心。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":223,"right":108,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-PROLOGUE:590:6","scriptId":590,"text":"（隆美尔司令真是用心良苦……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":223,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110003-EPILOGUE:10580:1","scriptId":10580,"text":"在太阳下山之前终于翻过了高地，进入了下坡。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":223,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-EPILOGUE:10580:2","scriptId":10580,"text":"“这周围好像并没有特别能过夜的庇护所。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":223,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-EPILOGUE:10580:3","scriptId":10580,"text":"“那就用我这辆吉普车上的应急帐篷吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":223,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-EPILOGUE:10580:4","scriptId":10580,"text":"“好的，那就用帐篷扎营吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-EPILOGUE:10580:5","scriptId":10580,"text":"“不过帐篷可能有点小……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":231,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-EPILOGUE:10580:6","scriptId":10580,"text":"“挤一挤就好啦～我不介意睡你旁边的～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-EPILOGUE:10580:7","scriptId":10580,"text":"“呃……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110003-EPILOGUE:10580:8","scriptId":10580,"text":"（我还是主动申请出去站岗吧……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-03.webp","left":231,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["原以为可以很顺利的到达研究所，可能是我把事情想简单了？","高地路线绕了点远路，不过视野极好，对行进更有帮助。但是我总觉得这趟旅途更像是佐伊她们的户外教学课……","户外教学，不，是搜索任务继续进行中……"]}
